# Boost on 10's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# There is no Pokemon Center between Floaroma and Mars, and the windworks grunts poison and wear the lead down
# (seen at 25: Mars's battle entered poisoned at 22/72 HP and lost to TRAINER_COMMANDER_MARS_VALLEY_WINDWORKS:
# ZUBAT 15, PURUGLY 17). party-level refills HP; the Lum Berry cures the first poison.
party-level 0 30
party-item 0 ITEM_LUM_BERRY
